00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:29.325
Cambodia has beautiful traditions. We greet our teachers with a sampeah. Grandpa wears a krama around his neck, and Grandma wears a silk sampot. At the pagoda fair, there is an ox cart race. Children fly a Khmer kite that sings in the wind. Grandma makes rice cakes in a coconut leaf.

